00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,393
Exam tip.

2
00:00:01,393 --> 00:00:04,218
Two definitions examiners love.

3
00:00:04,218 --> 00:00:07,877
Periderm is phellogen plus phellem plus phelloderm.

4
00:00:07,877 --> 00:00:11,679
Bark is everything outside the vascular cambium.

5
00:00:11,679 --> 00:00:16,653
Write them in exactly those words, and never call the cork alone the bark.

